'''Kaleidoscopic Mineral''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Reforge Stone]] which can apply the {{reforge|Headstrong}} [[Reforge]] to [[Bows]], which grants {{stat|str}}, {{stat|cd}} and {{stat|cc}}.

