==Usage==
===Reforging===
'''Kaleidoscopic Mineral''' can be applied to [[Bows]] using an [[Anvil]] or [[The Hex]] to apply the {{Reforge|Headstrong}} reforge, to grant {{Stat|str}}, {{stat|cd}} and {{stat|cc}}, which scale with the bow's rarity. This has a skill requirement of {{skill|mining|15}}. A bow that is already reforged to {{reforge|Headstrong}} will grant the stats, even if the player doesn't meet the requirement to apply it.

Additionally, it grants the '''{{blue|Headstrong Bonus}}''', which grants {{red|+8%}} more damage when hitting a mob's head. 

